      "created_at": "2018-06-04T15:00:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It has recently been brought to my attention that if Invaders have a 2+ damage modifier they can blight the land even if every Invader in that land is strifed (pg. 11 of B&amp;C rulebook). This doesn't make sense to me; if all the Invaders are unable to deal damage due to being strifed, then who/what is blighting the land?</p>",
