      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-06-15T00:07:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The FAQ is for rules and product information, and the wiki is for lore. But the above is the intersection of the two - the thematic reasoning behind a mechanical decision. I'm not quite sure where that should go, outside of \"designer diaries\".</p><p>The purpose of the FAQ is for people to look up answers to questions about the game that arise as part of playing or researching it, so I&nbsp;<em>think</em></p>",
